    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθίημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>letting down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κόμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					1.109
				</span></i>
			; of a diving-bell, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				960b33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>production</i> of a play, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1317
			</span></i>, prob. in Sch.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1060
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1096
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>insertion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ αὐλίσκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; of a finger, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.23.1
			</span></i>; of a lancet, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.5.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>descent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				356a11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. νέφους εἰς τοὺς κάτω τόπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.47U.
				</span></i>
			</div>
